		(descr "Spring-clamp terminal block, 3 pole, 2.54mm pitch, vertical wire entry. Body (N+1)*2.54 = 10.16 x 12.6 x 13.6mm: three 2.54mm pole sections plus a 2.54mm end cap, 0.9mm of wall before pin 1. Two rows of pins 5.08mm apart; both rows of a pole share one net. 4UCON 11380 / drawing 1424XGKG02, sold as SparkFun PRT-08074, Electrokit 41020662. Drill 1.2mm per manufacturer PCB layout.")
